msgstr "Bukti di peta"

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "Each point of light is a passage this chapter cites, placed where it speaks of. Select one to read it."
msgstr "Setiap titik cahaya adalah kutipan teks yang dirujuk bab ini, ditempatkan di lokasi yang dibicarakan. Pilih satu untuk membacanya."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "This is the story of the Hijrah: when the Prophet Muhammad ﷺ travelled from Makkah to Madinah, a new home."
msgstr "Ini adalah kisah Hijrah: ketika Nabi Muhammad ﷺ melakukan perjalanan dari Makkah ke Madinah, sebuah rumah baru."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Many Muslims had already gone ahead. His best friend, Abu Bakr, waited so that they could travel together."
msgstr "Banyak umat Islam yang sudah berangkat lebih dulu. Sahabat karibnya, Abu Bakar, menunggu agar mereka bisa melakukan perjalanan bersama."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "The Prophet ﷺ and Abu Bakr hid in a cave on Mount Thawr for three nights."
msgstr "Nabi ﷺ dan Abu Bakar bersembunyi di sebuah gua di Bukit Thawr selama tiga malam."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Each night, Abu Bakr’s son ‘Abdullah came in the dark to tell them the news from Makkah."
msgstr "Setiap malam, putra Abu Bakar yang bernama 'Abdullah datang dalam kegelapan untuk menyampaikan kabar dari Makkah."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "A shepherd called ‘Amir brought his sheep close every evening, so that they had milk to drink."
msgstr "Seorang penggembala bernama 'Amir membawa domba-dombanya mendekat setiap sore, sehingga mereka memiliki susu untuk diminum."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Abu Bakr was worried: if someone looked down, they would be seen! The Prophet ﷺ calmed him."
msgstr "Abu Bakar merasa khawatir: jika ada yang melihat ke bawah, mereka akan terlihat! Nabi ﷺ menenangkannya."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "The Quran remembers what the Prophet ﷺ said to his friend in the cave: do not be sad, Allah is with us."
msgstr "Al-Qur'an merekam apa yang dikatakan Nabi ﷺ kepada sahabatnya di dalam gua: jangan bersedih, sesungguhnya Allah bersama kita."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Quraysh offered a big reward to catch them. A rider called Suraqah raced after them on his horse."
msgstr "Quraisy menawarkan hadiah besar untuk menangkap mereka. Seorang penunggang kuda bernama Suraqah mengejar mereka dengan kudanya."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "As he came close, his horse’s legs sank into the ground, and he fell off!"
msgstr "Ketika dia sudah dekat, kaki kudanya terperosok ke dalam tanah, dan dia pun terjatuh!"

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Suraqah gave up the chase. They asked him only to keep their secret, and went on their way."
msgstr "Suraqah menghentikan pengejaran. Mereka hanya memintanya untuk menjaga rahasia keberadaan mereka, lalu melanjutkan perjalanan."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "At last they reached Madinah! The Prophet’s camel walked through the town and knelt in an open yard."
msgstr "Akhirnya mereka sampai di Madinah! Unta Nabi berjalan menyusuri kota dan berlutut di sebuah tanah lapang."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "That yard became the place of his mosque, and he carried bricks to help build it."
msgstr "Tanah lapang itu kemudian menjadi tempat masjid beliau, dan beliau ikut mengangkat batu bata untuk membantu membangunnya."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "One hot noon, the Prophet ﷺ came to Abu Bakr’s house with big news: it was time to go. Abu Bakr asked to come too, and he said yes."
msgstr "Suatu siang yang panas, Nabi ﷺ datang ke rumah Abu Bakar membawa kabar besar: sudah waktunya untuk berangkat. Abu Bakar meminta untuk ikut serta, dan beliau mengiyakannya."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Abu Bakr took all his money for the journey. His daughter Asma put stones in its place to comfort her grandfather, who could not see."
msgstr "Abu Bakr membawa seluruh uangnya untuk perjalanan ini. Putrinya, Asma, meletakkan batu-batu di tempat penyimpanan uang tersebut untuk menenangkan kakeknya yang tidak bisa melihat."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Asma used her belt to tie up their food bag. People called her “the one with two belts”."
msgstr "Asma menggunakan ikat pinggangnya untuk mengikat kantong makanan mereka. Orang-orang menjulukinya \"pemilik dua ikat pinggang\"."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "One report says the searchers saw a spider’s web across the cave and walked away."
msgstr "Satu riwayat menyebutkan bahwa para pencari melihat sarang laba-laba di mulut gua lalu pergi."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Their guide knew the desert well. He led them along the coast, past many places whose names we still know."
msgstr "Pemandu mereka sangat mengenal padang pasir dengan baik. Ia memandu mereka menyusuri pantai, melewati banyak tempat yang namanya masih kita ketahui hingga kini."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "On the way, a friend called al-Zubayr gave them new white clothes."
msgstr "Di tengah perjalanan, seorang sahabat bernama al-Zubayr memberi mereka pakaian putih baru."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "On his way into Madinah, the Prophet ﷺ led Friday prayer with about a hundred people."
msgstr "Dalam perjalanannya ke Madinah, Nabi ﷺ memimpin salat Jumat bersama sekitar seratus orang."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Everyone wanted the Prophet ﷺ to stay with them. He said: let the camel go, she has been told where to stop."
msgstr "Setiap orang ingin Nabi ﷺ tinggal bersama mereka. Beliau bersabda: biarkan unta ini pergi, karena ia telah diperintahkan ke mana harus berhenti."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "He stayed in the house of Abu Ayyub until his mosque and his home were built."
msgstr "Beliau tinggal di rumah Abu Ayyub sampai masjid dan rumah beliau selesai dibangun."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "He made the people who arrived and the people of Madinah brothers, to help each other."
msgstr "Beliau mempersaudarakan orang-orang yang baru datang dengan penduduk Madinah untuk saling membantu."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Many people remember a happy song sung to welcome him, but we are not sure it was sung that day."
msgstr "Banyak orang mengingat lagu gembira yang dinyanyikan untuk menyambut beliau, tetapi kita tidak yakin apakah lagu itu dinyanyikan pada hari itu."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "The Hijrah is so central that the Islamic calendar counts its years from it."
msgstr "Hijrah sangatlah penting sehingga kalender Islam menghitung tahunnya dimulai dari peristiwa tersebut."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Trust and careful planning sit side by side: the Prophet ﷺ relied on Allah and still prepared every step."
msgstr "Tawakal dan perencanaan yang matang berjalan beriringan: Nabi ﷺ berserah diri kepada Allah namun tetap mempersiapkan setiap langkah."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Even with people plotting against him, he made sure their property was returned. His honesty did not depend on how he was treated."
msgstr "Meskipun ada orang-orang yang berkomplot melawannya, beliau memastikan barang-barang milik mereka dikembalikan. Kejujuran beliau tidak bergantung pada bagaimana beliau diperlakukan."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "In the most frightening moment, the lesson is calm trust: Allah is with us."
msgstr "Di saat yang paling menakutkan, pelajarannya adalah ketenangan dalam bertawakal: Allah bersama kita."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Choosing an unexpected route was wisdom, not doubt. Muslims are taught to trust Allah and still take sensible steps."
msgstr "Memilih rute yang tidak terduga adalah sebuah kebijaksanaan, bukan keraguan. Umat Islam diajarkan untuk bertawakal kepada Allah namun tetap mengambil langkah-langkah yang masuk akal."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "A man who set out to capture them left asking for their protection. The story is full of reversals like this."
msgstr "Seorang pria yang pergi untuk menangkap mereka justru berbalik meminta perlindungan mereka. Kisah ini penuh dengan pembalikan nasib seperti ini."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Hospitality from strangers, and blessing in very little, run through the whole of the Prophet’s life."
msgstr "Keramahan dari orang asing, dan berkah dalam jumlah yang sangat sedikit, mengalir di sepanjang kehidupan Nabi."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Short for “peace and blessings of Allah be upon him”, said by Muslims after the Prophet’s name."
msgstr "Singkatan dari \"shallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam\" (semoga Allah memberikan selawat dan salam kepadanya), yang diucapkan oleh umat Islam setelah menyebut nama Nabi."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Hijrah"
msgstr "Hijrah"

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "The migration of the Prophet ﷺ and his companions from Makkah to Madinah, in 622."
msgstr "Migrasi Nabi ﷺ dan para sahabatnya dari Makkah ke Madinah pada tahun 622."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Quraysh"
msgstr "Quraisy"

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "The leading tribe of Makkah. The Prophet ﷺ himself belonged to it."
msgstr "Suku terkemuka di Makkah. Nabi ﷺ sendiri termasuk dalam suku ini."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "The city where the Prophet ﷺ was born, home of the Ka‘bah."
msgstr "Kota tempat Nabi ﷺ dilahirkan, rumah bagi Ka'bah."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Then called Yathrib: the city that welcomed the Prophet ﷺ. Its name means “the city”."
msgstr "Kala itu disebut Yatsrib: kota yang menyambut Nabi ﷺ. Namanya berarti \"kota\"."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Abu Bakr"
msgstr "Abu Bakar"

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "The Prophet’s closest friend and companion, who later led the Muslims after him."
msgstr "Sahabat terdekat Nabi, yang kemudian memimpin umat Islam setelah beliau wafat."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Allah"
msgstr "Allah"

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "The Arabic word for God."
msgstr "Kata bahasa Arab untuk Tuhan."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "The holy book of Islam, which Muslims believe is the word of Allah."
msgstr "Kitab suci umat Islam, yang diyakini oleh umat Islam sebagai firman Allah."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "The collection of hadith that Muslims consider the most reliable."
msgstr "Kumpulan hadis yang dianggap paling sahih oleh umat Islam."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Ibn Kathir"
msgstr "Ibn Katsir"

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "A scholar of the fourteenth century whose history of the Prophet’s life is widely used."
msgstr "Seorang ulama abad ke-14 yang kitab sejarah kehidupan Nabi karyanya digunakan secara luas."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Ibn Ishaq"
msgstr "Ibn Ishaq"

#: src/content/lenses.js
#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Thawr"
msgstr "Thawr"

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "A mountain south of Makkah, with a small cave near its top."
msgstr "Sebuah gunung di selatan Makkah, dengan gua kecil di dekat puncaknya."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "A village on the edge of Madinah, where the Prophet ﷺ stopped first."
msgstr "Sebuah desa di pinggiran Madinah, tempat pertama kali Nabi ﷺ singgah."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "A passage of the Quran, the holy book of Islam."
msgstr "Satu ayat atau bagian dari Al-Qur'an, kitab suci umat Islam."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "A hadith: a report of the Prophet’s words or deeds, passed on through named narrators. The collections of al-Bukhari and Muslim are considered the most reliable."
msgstr "Hadis: riwayat tentang perkataan atau perbuatan Nabi, yang disampaikan melalui perawi yang disebutkan namanya. Kitab kumpulan hadis al-Bukhari dan Muslim dianggap sebagai yang paling sahih."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "A report from the early histories of the Prophet’s life. They gather many accounts, some stronger than others."
msgstr "Sebuah riwayat dari sejarah awal kehidupan Nabi. Riwayat-riwayat tersebut mengumpulkan banyak kisah, beberapa di antaranya lebih kuat dari yang lain."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "A modern author’s explanation or calculation, built on the early sources."
msgstr "Penjelasan atau perhitungan penulis modern, yang disusun berdasarkan sumber-sumber awal."

