#, ai
msgid "Mode"
msgstr "Mode"

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "How would you like to follow the journey?"
msgstr "Bagaimana Anda ingin mengikuti perjalanan ini?"

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "Six short stages, in simple words."
msgstr "Enam tahap singkat, dengan kata-kata sederhana."

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "Terms explained, and why each stage matters."
msgstr "Istilah-istilah dijelaskan, serta mengapa setiap tahap itu penting."

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "Every detail, with the evidence and the timeline open."
msgstr "Setiap detail, dengan bukti sejarah dan lini masa yang terbuka."

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "Why this matters:"
msgstr "Mengapa ini penting:"

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "Terms"
msgstr "Istilah"

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "Abu Bakr prepared two camels. Asma helped pack food for the journey."
msgstr "Abu Bakar menyiapkan dua unta. Asma membantu membungkus bekal makanan untuk perjalanan."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "They chose a guide who knew the roads well. He would bring their camels after three nights."
msgstr "Mereka memilih seorang penunjuk jalan yang paham betul jalur-jalur yang ada. Ia akan membawakan unta mereka setelah tiga malam."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "An early account tells how the leaders of Quraysh met in Makkah to plan against the Prophet ﷺ."
msgstr "Sebuah riwayat awal menceritakan bagaimana para pemimpin Quraisy berkumpul di Makkah untuk merencanakan makar terhadap Nabi ﷺ."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "The account says they waited outside his door that night, while ‘Ali slept in his bed, wrapped in his green cloak."
msgstr "Riwayat itu menyebutkan bahwa mereka menunggu di luar pintu malam itu, sementara ‘Ali tidur di tempat tidurnya dengan berselimutkan jubah hijau miliknya."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "After three nights, their guide brought the camels. They left the cave and travelled towards Madinah."
msgstr "Setelah tiga malam, penunjuk jalan mereka membawa unta-unta itu. Mereka meninggalkan gua dan berangkat menuju Madinah."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "They took a route near the coast. The journey was long, with many stops along the way."
msgstr "Mereka mengambil rute dekat pantai. Perjalanannya panjang, dengan banyak persinggahan di sepanjang jalan."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "Another account describes a stop at Umm Ma‘bad’s tent. She had a thin sheep that was not giving milk."
msgstr "Riwayat lain menggambarkan persinggahan di tenda Ummu Ma‘bad. Ia memiliki seekor domba kurus yang tidak mengeluarkan susu."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "It says the Prophet ﷺ prayed and milked the sheep, and there was milk for everyone."
msgstr "Dikatakan bahwa Nabi ﷺ berdoa lalu memerah susu domba itu, dan susu pun cukup untuk semua orang."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "They first stopped at Quba, near Madinah, where a mosque was founded."
msgstr "Mula-mula mereka berhenti di Quba, dekat Madinah, tempat sebuah masjid didirikan."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "Madinah is to the north. They went south first, towards Mount Thawr."
msgstr "Madinah berada di sebelah utara. Mereka pergi ke arah selatan terlebih dahulu, menuju Gunung Tsur."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "A mosque was founded at Quba, making worship a part of life in the new home."
msgstr "Sebuah masjid didirikan di Quba, menjadikan ibadah bagian dari kehidupan di tempat tinggal yang baru."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "Madinah became a home for the growing Muslim community, bringing newcomers and their hosts together."
msgstr "Madinah menjadi rumah bagi komunitas Muslim yang kian berkembang, mempertemukan kaum pendatang dengan tuan rumah mereka."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "An eighth-century historian whose accounts of the Prophet’s life are preserved by later writers."
msgstr "Seorang sejarawan abad kedelapan yang catatan-catatannya tentang kehidupan Nabi dilestarikan oleh para penulis setelahnya."

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
msgid "Mode changed. Your place is saved."
msgstr "Mode diubah. Posisi Anda tersimpan."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "‘Ali stayed behind to return the precious things that people had left with the Prophet ﷺ."
msgstr "‘Ali tetap tinggal untuk mengembalikan barang-barang berharga yang dititipkan orang-orang kepada Nabi ﷺ."

#: src/lib/scene-manifest.js
msgid "E09"
msgstr "E09"

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "In Madinah, Muslims went out to wait for the Prophet ﷺ. The arrival account tells how they welcomed him."
msgstr "Di Madinah, kaum Muslim keluar untuk menunggu Nabi ﷺ. Kisah kedatangan menceritakan bagaimana mereka menyambut beliau."

